<title>POLAND: NBP-BILLS SOLD AT AVG PRICE 86.86, AVG YIELD 19.95.</title>
<headline>NBP-BILLS SOLD AT AVG PRICE 86.86, AVG YIELD 19.95.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average price of 273-day NBP-bills at Friday's 300 million zloty sale was 86.86 and the average yield was 19.95 percent, 0.02 point up from Thursday's auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
